367 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 256 0 R
/E (With the rapid growth of digital transactions, ensuring security in online payment systems has become increasingly critical. This project presents a Fraud-Aware E- Wallet System designed to provide secure, efficient, and user-friendly digital payment services while actively detecting and preventing fraudulent activities. The system allows users to perform essential financial operations such as account creation, balance management, money transfers, and transaction history tracking. In addition to these standard features, the system integrates fraud detection mechanisms that monitor user behavior and transaction patterns to identify suspicious activities. Alerts are generated for unusual transactions, such as abnormal transfer amounts or irregular login attempts, enhancing the overall security of the platform. The application is developed using object-oriented programming principles, ensuring modularity, scalability, and maintainability. It also includes features like authentication, transaction validation, and secure data handling to protect user information. This project aims to demonstrate how intelligent monitoring and basic fraud detection techniques can be incorporated into digital payment systems to improve reliability and user trust. The Fraud-Aware E-Wallet System serves as a foundational model for building more advanced and secure financial applications in the future. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
