/P 259 0 R
/E (The system is developed using industry-standard technologies. The frontend uses HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. The backend API is built with Node.js and Express.js following the MVC \(Model-View-Controller\) architecture pattern. MySQL 8.0 serves as the relational database management system, providing advanced features such as stored procedures, triggers, views, and ACID-compliant transactions. Firebase Authentication handles secure user login. The ML fraud detection model is built using Python's scikit-learn library and served via a Flask REST API. All tools used are open-source and freely available, making the project technically feasible without any licensing costs. )
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [7]
>>
